package com.example.ui.theme

/*
 * CLG 1% THEME PACK  (single file, Material 3, no extra libraries)
 *
 * 9 colour palettes + Material You ("Dynamic"), each with light and dark variants, a picker screen
 * and saved choice. Every colour pair is generated by code that GUARANTEES readable contrast
 * (text on background/surface/containers >= 4.5:1, outlines >= 3:1); this is unit tested in ClgThemesTest.kt.
 *
 * HOW TO WIRE (see Clg1_AIStudio_Prompt_Themes_UX.md):
 *   1. Add this file to package com.example.ui.theme.
 *   2. Make your existing MyApplicationTheme delegate to ClgPaletteTheme (snippet at the bottom of this file).
 *   3. In MainActivity:  val (palette, setPalette) = rememberClgPalette()   and pass palette into MyApplicationTheme.
 *   4. Show ClgThemePicker(...) somewhere in Settings.
 *
 * Written without being compiled. If the compiler complains, fix imports first.
 */

